               <note type="editorial">
                  <p>Lydia Ives married Thomas Harvey (d.1772), who was Mayor of Norwich in 1748. Their son <persName key="HAR07">Thomas Harvey</persName> married <persName ref="HAR13">Ann Twiss</persName> in 1774 at Norwich.</p>
                  <p>Thomas' older brother Robert Harvey married a Lydia Black and had a son, RObert, in 1736. That side of the family were Tories.</p>
               </note>
